  "description": "Secluded deep within the forest, Wen has never experienced life outside her cottage home. Alongside her over-protective grandmother, they both live under a protective seal that had kept them unseen from the rest of the world. Every day she is told to remain safe and to never go beyond the woods past the stone markers. However, curiosity takes hold of her as she longs to experience the vast outside world for herself. But little did she know the real mystery and danger that lies behind her doorstep.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
